sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant R as tokenRoutes
    participant TC as TokenController
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant UR as UserRepository
    participant DB as MySQL

    C->>R: POST /tokens/ { email, password }
    R->>TC: store(req, res)
    TC->>AS: login(email, password)

    alt email or password missing
        AS-->>TC: throws UnauthorizedError(401)
    else credentials provided
        AS->>UR: findByEmail(email)
        UR->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
        DB-->>UR: user row (or null)
        UR-->>AS: User | null

        alt user not found
            AS-->>TC: throws UnauthorizedError(401)
        else user found
            AS->>AS: user.passwordIsValid(password)
            alt password invalid
                AS-->>TC: throws UnauthorizedError(401)
            else password valid
                AS->>AS: jwt.sign({ id, email }, TOKEN_SECRET)
                AS-->>TC: { token, user }
                TC-->>C: 200 { token, user }
            end
        end
    end

    Note over TC,C: On any thrown error, the errorHandler middleware<br/>turns it into { errors: [...] } with the error's statusCode.
